{"chapter": "defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "08S3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$0 \\to I \\to A' \\to A \\to 0$", "MATH_0002": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0003": "$c : I \\to N$", "MATH_0004": "$\\xi \\in \\Ext^1_A(\\NL_{A/A'}, I)$", "MATH_0005": "$A'$", "MATH_0006": "$A$", "MATH_0007": "$I$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\Ext^1_B(\\NL_{B/A'}, N) \\to \\Ext^1_A(\\NL_{A/A'}, N)\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$\\xi$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-to-solve}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-extensions-of-algebras}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-parametrize-solutions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8aace0742feb152b723a7b0743fc3f994fc077bd3275b21069299ba060f33623", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e6869d0fcd4bdba0ed99382578d64de2f61b589d587d3612d9cf997cb776b4b0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002>, and <MATH_0003> be as in\n(<REF_0001>). Denote <MATH_0004>\nthe element corresponding to the extension <MATH_0005> of <MATH_0006> by <MATH_0007> via\nLemma <REF_0002>. The set of isomorphism\nclasses of solutions is canonically bijective to the fibre of\n<MATH_0008>\nover the image of <MATH_0009>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b4915144caf0445d6d1f466ed82309e5a90911246e8aaf6c2e3e16556dcfa8de", "unit_id": "tag:0GPX:statement"}
{"chapter": "defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "08S3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A' \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$N$", "MATH_0004": "$\\zeta$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Ext^1_B(\\NL_{B/A'}, N)$", "MATH_0006": "$0 \\to N \\to B' \\to B \\to 0$", "MATH_0007": "$A'$", "MATH_0008": "$A' \\to A \\to B$", "MATH_0009": "$c : I \\to N$", "MATH_0010": "$A'$", "MATH_0011": "$A' \\to B'$", "MATH_0012": "$c$", "MATH_0013": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0014": "$\\zeta$", "MATH_0015": "$\\xi$", "MATH_0016": "$B'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-extensions-of-algebras}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-extensions-of-algebras-functorial}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{equation-to-solve}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3410b0f37b2d4839c41d5335287c69132870f75bae6f97a13813eb1d7753760d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:10819b728a54b9708c8e6a8d1afcf57d960028be9b88f2c3ac1e44c1e8f69345", "source_text": "By Lemma <REF_0001> applied to <MATH_0001> and\nthe <MATH_0002>-module <MATH_0003> we see that elements <MATH_0004> of <MATH_0005>\nparametrize extensions <MATH_0006> of <MATH_0007>-algebras.\nBy Lemma <REF_0002> applied\nto <MATH_0008> and <MATH_0009> we see that there is an <MATH_0010>-algebra\nmap <MATH_0011> compatible with <MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> if and only if\n<MATH_0014> maps to <MATH_0015>. Of course this is the same thing as saying <MATH_0016> is a\nsolution of (<REF_0003>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8bb56bb0f652786787bdab936df6afe45631b1e1c48d70cd3375955ce103b4f0", "unit_id": "tag:0GPX:proof"}
{"chapter": "defos", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "08S3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\Ext^1_A(\\NL_{A/A'}, N) =\n\\Ext^1_B(\\NL_{A/A'} \\otimes_A^\\mathbf{L} B, N) =\n\\Ext^1_B(\\NL_{A/A'} \\otimes_A B, N)\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\NL_{A/A'} \\otimes_A B \\to \\NL_{B/A'} \\to \\NL_{B/A}\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$\\xi$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Ext^2_B(\\NL_{B/A}, N)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-parametrize-solutions}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{more-algebra-lemma-tensor-hom-adjoint}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{more-algebra-lemma-tensor-NL}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-exact-sequence-NL}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{equation-to-solve}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-parametrize-solutions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:cced0acc42509f30bad1231776f3674aa5c3d69707a756513ecdc43e7dab0797", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e0a5217bac768ed19582dcf03332dbc0a3be78b68b04f44f88fb0cc97ae4ae09", "source_text": "Observe that in the situation of Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe have\n<MATH_0001>\nThe first equality by\nMore on Algebra, Lemma <REF_0002> and\nthe second by\nMore on Algebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nWe have maps of complexes\n<MATH_0002>\nwhich is close to being a distinguished triangle, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0004>.\nIf it were a distinguished triangle we would conclude\nthat the image of <MATH_0003> in <MATH_0004>\nwould be the obstruction to the existence of a solution to\n(<REF_0005>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4533931e701173f0ff76d1f3de4fa542a3a00f6400347b6de5c507af9e34460d", "unit_id": "tag:0GPY:statement"}
